{% extends "admin/base_site.html" %}
{% load i18n static %}

{% comment %}
Passthrough: full upstream document rendered inside the content column only.
ALL upstream HTML (head styles + body) goes in the scope div — nothing in extrahead.
This prevents Mattermost's global CSS from blowing out the sidebar and header.
{% endcomment %}

{% block bodyclass %}polysaas-passthrough-embed-page{% endblock %}

